DATA NOTE

This repository contains no licensed or restricted data. `data/tle_cache.json`
and `data/tle_baseline.json` hold two-line element sets published by
CelesTrak (public domain) and a public per-satellite mirror. They are
regenerable with `python run.py` and are excluded from version control by
.gitignore.

No Indigenous knowledge, story, artwork, recording, or community-held material
is included, reproduced, or redistributed in this repository. Indigenous
Cultural and Intellectual Property and community consent conditions take
precedence over this licence.
